GET /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/custom_csrs/{custom_csr_id}
Retrieve details for a specific custom Certificate Signing Request (CSR).
Required: custom_csr_id (path); account_id (path)

DELETE /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/custom_csrs/{custom_csr_id}
Delete a custom Certificate Signing Request (CSR) and its associated private key.
Required: custom_csr_id (path); account_id (path)
